WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.133 --> 00:00:06.369
My brother is asleep.

2
00:00:06.370 --> 00:00:11.366
I am awake.

3
00:00:11.367 --> 00:00:15.474
His bed is on the top.

4
00:00:15.475 --> 00:00:20.906
Mine is on the bottom.

5
00:00:20.907 --> 00:00:25.533
He is outside the bathroom.

6
00:00:25.534 --> 00:00:31.503
I am inside the bathroom.

7
00:00:31.504 --> 00:00:34.711
His piggy bank is heavy.

8
00:00:34.712 --> 00:00:40.167
Mine is light.

9
00:00:40.168 --> 00:00:43.726
His cookie jar is empty.

10
00:00:43.727 --> 00:00:49.296
Mine is full.

11
00:00:49.297 --> 00:00:53.779
His bike is big.

12
00:00:53.780 --> 00:00:59.053
Mine is small.

13
00:00:59.054 --> 00:01:03.323
He is fast.

14
00:01:03.324 --> 00:01:09.472
I am slow.

15
00:01:09.473 --> 00:01:13.287
He is up and I am down.

16
00:01:13.288 --> 00:01:18.704
I am up and he is down.

17
00:01:18.705 --> 00:01:22.104
His jump rope is long.

18
00:01:22.105 --> 00:01:27.799
Mine is short.

19
00:01:27.800 --> 00:01:31.648
But we both love Mom and Dad.

20
00:01:31.649 --> 00:01:37.259
And we are one happy family.

